    <baseline year="2021">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected outcomes from the national consultation
a. A national vision for a healthy planet and shared prosperity,
b. Recommendations of priority actions for governments, civil society, and private sector to advance national and sectoral policies that address climate change and leverage nature-based solutions,
c. Representation of the voices of the poor, youth, women, indigenous groups, local communities, and other marginalised groups in the national statement for Stockholm+50.

Output 7: Stockholm+50 Preparations 
Strengthened ownership and engagement across stakeholders for the Stockholm +50 Conference 
7.1 Support a bottom-up, whole-of-society, whole-of-government approach to national consultations in up to 60 countries. 
Stockholm +50 Consultation, Roadmaps, Reporting, and linked- data and comms work delivered.</narrative>
     </comment>
